title: "AI Governance Kit"
abstract: >-
  Framework-aligned tools for governing AI systems: 34 AI controls (including 8 for AI agents)
  mapped to the NIST AI RMF, ISO/IEC 42001 and the EU AI Act; a five-dimension risk scoring
  model; and an EU AI Act tier screening guide.
